STRING ACCESS
-------------
1. Display string using variable name.
    name = "Akash"
    print(name)
    output
    ------
    Akash

2. Display string character by character (using loop)
    name = "Akash"
    for ch in name:
        print(ch)
    Output
    ------
    A
    k
    a
    s
    h
    
3. Display specific character using index
name = "Akash"
print(name[0])  # First character
print(name[2])  # Third character
Output:
-------
A
a

4. Display part of string using slicing
name = "Akash"
print(name[0:3])   # From index 0 to 2
print(name[2:])    # From index 2 to end
Output:
-------
Aka
ash

